  [1mDesign[0m

  - Add to [38;5;153mindex.html[39m, inside [38;5;153m<main>[39m: a [38;5;153m<ul>[39m of task items, each item a [38;5;153m<label>[39m wrapping [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m plus
